#: action/awesome-shortcode.php:143
#, php-format
msgid ""
"</code>' does not exist. It seems you have added the gallery shortcode with "
"an ID that hasn't been created yet using the Awesome Responsive Photo "
"Gallery plugin.<br><br>\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4>What to Do?</h4>\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ol>\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Navigate to the <a href=\"%1$s\" target=\"_blank\">"
"<strong>Gallery Management</strong></a> page in the plugin to create a new "
"gallery.</li>\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>After creating the gallery, ensure that the ID matches "
"the one you've used in the shortcode.</li>\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</ol>\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\tIf you need step-by-step instructions, please visit the <a "
"href=\"%2$s\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Help</strong></a> page for detailed "
"guidance.\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>"
msgstr ""

#: action/awesome-shortcode.php:168
#, php-format
msgid ""
"<div style=\"display:inline-block;margin:0;padding:15px;border-radius:5px;"
"margin-bottom:10px;background-color:#e7f4fd;border:1px solid #5da4ff;color:"
"#007bff;font-size:15px;line-height:24px\">\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4>Gallery Options Not Configured</h4>\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\tIt seems you've created a gallery but haven't added any "
"settings yet. To configure your gallery and obtain the unique <strong>"
"SHORTCODE ID</strong>, please follow these steps:\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ol>\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Navigate to the <a href=\"%1$s\" target=\"_blank\">"
"<strong>Gallery List</strong></a> page in your dashboard.</li>\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Hover over the name of the gallery you just created.</li>"
"\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Click on <strong>Add Options</strong> to customize your "
"gallery settings.</li>\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>After saving the settings, you will see the unique "
"<strong>SHORTCODE ID</strong> assigned to your gallery.</li>\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</ol>\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\tOnce you've completed these steps, update your page with the "
"correct <strong>ID</strong> in the shortcode to display the gallery properly."
"<br>\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\tFor detailed guidance, visit the <a href=\"%2$s\" "
"target=\"_blank\"><strong>Help Page</strong></a> or refer to the "
"documentation.\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>"
msgstr ""

#: action/awesome-shortcode.php:115
#, php-format
msgid ""
"<div style=\"display:inline-block;margin:0;padding:15px;border-radius:5px;"
"margin-bottom:10px;background-color:#f9d4d4;border:1px solid #e66464;color:"
"#b63737;font-size:15px;line-height:24px\">\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4>Gallery Data Not Found</h4>\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\tIt seems no galleries have been created using the plugin yet. "
"The system relies on the <strong>Gallery List</strong> to function correctly,"
" but the required data is missing.<br>\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\tTo resolve this issue, please create a gallery by following "
"these steps:\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ol>\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Go to the <a href=\"%1$s\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>"
"Gallery List</strong></a> page in your WordPress dashboard.</li>\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Click on <strong>Add New</strong>.</li>\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Enter the name of the gallery and click on <strong>Add "
"Gallery</strong>.</li>\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Hover over the gallery name and click on <strong>Add "
"Options</strong> to configure your gallery settings.</li>\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</ol>\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\tOnce a gallery has been created, the system will update "
"automatically, and you can use the shortcode with the appropriate gallery ID "
"to display it on your site.<br>\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\tFor step-by-step instructions, visit the <a href=\"%2$s\" "
"target=\"_blank\"><strong>Help Page</strong></a>.\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>"
msgstr ""

#: action/awesome-shortcode.php:95
#, php-format
msgid ""
"<div style=\"display:inline-block;margin:0;padding:15px;border-radius:5px;"
"margin-bottom:10px;background-color:#f9d4d4;border:1px solid #e66464;color:"
"#b63737;font-size:15px;line-height:24px\">\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4>Gallery ID is not specified!</h4>\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>To display your gallery correctly, please add a <strong>"
"unique ID</strong> to the gallery shortcode like below:</p>\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>[gallery <strong>id=\"1\"</strong> ids=\"45,43,22,23,31,32,"
"34,15\"]</p>\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\tFor step-by-step instructions, visit the <a href=\"%1$s\" "
"target=\"_blank\"><strong>Help</strong></a> page.\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>"
msgstr ""

